  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jamalam.tech/mod-assets/jamlib-banner.png\" alt=\"JamLib：用於 JamCore 所有模組的跨平台函式庫\"></p><div>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/JamCoreModding/jamlib\" rel=\"nofollow\">回報問題</a> • <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.jamalam.tech%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Discord 上聊天</a> • <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jamlib\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> • <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjamlib\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></p>\n</div><p>JamLib 提供：</p><ul>\n<li>跨平台抽象層</li>\n<li>JSON5 設定 API</li>\n<li>模組轉載（如 9minecraft 等）檢查器</li>\n</ul><p>完整的說明文件可在<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.jamalam.tech%252fjamlib%252fgetting-started%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>找到。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fjamalam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e0cc6668-0d29-40ff-9820-4d4f5433198a.webp\" alt=\"透過 Bisect Hosting 租用伺服器：使用優惠碼 jamalam 可享 75 折優惠\"></a></p>",
